<remarks>
    <remark_en><![CDATA[Updates will be provided for train service disruptions*, adjustments or enhancements. Please refer to the latest Traffic News.<br/><br/>*Including Heavy Rail lines with an estimated additional travelling time of more than 20 minutes<br/>]]></remark_en>
    <remark_tc><![CDATA[當列車服務受阻* 、需調整或加強服務時，我們會適時提供相關資訊。請留意最新車務狀況。<br/><br/>*包括重鐵綫路預計額外行車時間超過20分鐘<br/>]]></remark_tc>
